  },
  "en:Torah Readings/Hatan Torah and Hatan Bereshit:3": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "By leave of great,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " mighty and awesome God;",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " by leave of [the Torah] who is more precious than fine gold and pearls;",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " by leave of the holy and chosen Sanhedrin,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " the leaders in Torah and heads of the academies,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " and the elders and young men seated in their rows: I shall open my mouth in poetry and song,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " in thanks and praise to the One encircled in light,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " who gives us life,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " sustains us,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " in pure awe,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " who brings us to rejoice at this Simḥat Torah that delights the heart and lights up the eyes,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " gives life and richness,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " dignity and splendor,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " brings happiness to those who walk the straight path of goodness,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " lengthens life,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " heightens strength of those who love and keep her with care,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " attentively,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " those busy with her,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " who guard her in love and awe. And so,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " from the Mighty One,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " it should be His will that grace,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " kindness and life,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " crown and diadem,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " be given to (",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": "<i>name</i>",
     "kind": "instruction"
    },
    {
     "text": " son of ",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": "<i>father’s name</i>",
     "kind": "instruction"
    },
    {
     "text": "),",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " the one chosen to complete the Torah. Strengthen him,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " bless him,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " nurture him in the learning of Torah,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " make him sought after,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " praised,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " included in the company of learners,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " make him worthy,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " vital,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " honor him in the splendor of light,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " make him strong,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " crown him,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " teach him Torah and its way of thinking,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " protect him,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " elevate him,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " support him with direct assistance,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " give him sustenance,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " make him refined and righteous among Your created people,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " bring him close,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " show him mercy,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " guard him from pain and precipice,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " give him fortitude,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " sustain him,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " make him whole in broken spirit. Stand,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " stand,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " stand (",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": "<i>name</i>",
     "kind": "instruction"
    },
    {
     "text": " son of ",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": "<i>father’s name</i>",
     "kind": "instruction"
    },
    {
     "text": "),",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " groom to the Torah,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " give honor to great,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " awesome God;",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " for this you shall merit from the awesome God to see your children and grandchildren busy themselves in Torah and fulfill the commandments amongst this beautiful,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " pure people;",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " and you shall be worthy of rejoicing in the joy of the Temple,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " the Chosen House,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " and your face should light up in righteousness like [the Presence of God through] shining glass,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " as Isaiah,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " filled with the spirit of wisdom and strength,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " prophesied: Rejoice with Jerusalem,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " be happy with her,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " soon,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " rejoice with her in joyfulness,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " all you who grieved in pain and mourning. Stand,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " stand,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " stand (",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": "<i>name</i>",
     "kind": "instruction"
    },
    {
     "text": " son of ",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": "<i>father’s name</i>",
     "kind": "instruction"
    },
    {
     "text": "),",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " groom to the Torah;",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " by leave of this holy congregation,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " complete the Torah. Arise (",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": "<i>name</i>",
     "kind": "instruction"
    },
    {
     "text": " son of ",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": "<i>father’s name</i>",
     "kind": "instruction"
    },
    {
     "text": "),",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " Ḥatan HaTorah.",
     "kind": "prayer"
    }
   ],
   "he": [
    "he:Torah Readings/Hatan Torah and Hatan Bereshit:3"
   ]
